1. [THEOREM] Product Equals Multiplicand iff Multiplier is One for Positive Natural Numbers (Left Version)
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.mul_left_eq_self_iff
Description: For any natural numbers $a$ and $b$ with $b > 0$, the product $a \times b$ equals $b$ if and only if $a = 1$.
Signature:  (hb : 0 < b) : a * b = b ↔ a = 1

2. [THEOREM] Right multiplication identity: $a \times b = a \leftrightarrow b = 1$ for $a > 0$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.mul_right_eq_self_iff
Description: For any natural numbers $a$ and $b$ with $a > 0$, the product $a \times b$ equals $a$ if and only if $b = 1$.
Signature:  (ha : 0 < a) : a * b = a ↔ b = 1

3. [THEOREM] Sum Equals First Addend iff Second Addend is Zero
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.add_eq_left
Description: For natural numbers $a$ and $b$, the sum $a + b$ equals $a$ if and only if $b = 0$.
Signature:  : a + b = a ↔ b = 0

4. [THEOREM] Power Identity for Natural Numbers: $a^b = a \leftrightarrow b = 1$ when $a > 1$
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.pow_eq_self_iff
Description: For natural numbers $a > 1$ and $b$, the equality $a^b = a$ holds if and only if $b = 1$.
Signature:  {a b : ℕ} (ha : 1 < a) : a ^ b = a ↔ b = 1

5. [THEOREM] Subtraction from Sum Equals Addend
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.sub_eq_of_eq_add'
Description: For any natural numbers $a, b, c$ such that $a = b + c$, we have $a - b = c$.
Signature:  (h : a = b + c) : a - b = c

6. [THEOREM] Sum Equals Second Addend iff First is Zero
Module: Mathlib.Data.Nat.Defs
Name: Nat.add_eq_right
Description: For natural numbers $a$ and $b$, the sum $a + b$ equals $b$ if and only if $a = 0$.
Signature:  : a + b = b ↔ a = 0
