For example, given a CNF string representing the formula $(¬a ∧ ¬a₁ ∨ a ∧ ¬a₁) ∨ (¬a ∧ a₁ ∨ a ∧ a₁)$ and its LRAT proof, the command will generate a corresponding theorem in Lean's propositional logic syntax.
